OL,3,GNEWSADutch launch shows smugglers are
OL,4,Aadapting, says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FDover MP Mike Tapp says smugglers will
OL,7,Fkeep adapting after it was discovered
OL,8,Fthat a boat stopped in the Channel with
OL,9,F38 migrants on board had launched from
OL,10,Fthe Netherlands.
OL,12,FProsecutors have confirmed the vessel
OL,13,Fthat was found floating with no engine
OL,14,Fnear Cadzand on Saturday had entered
OL,15,Fthe water from Dutch territory.
OL,17,FThis year crossings have already been
OL,18,Fattempted along a wider stretch of
OL,19,Fcoast from Belgium to Normandy.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
